WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.044 --> 00:00:02.712
HOUSE ON MONDAY FOR A

00:00:02.713 --> 00:00:04.080
CELEBRATION BEFORE TAKING OFF

00:00:04.081 --> 00:00:04.747
FOR NEW ORLEANS.

00:00:04.748 --> 00:00:05.848
&gt;&gt;&gt; CONGRESS HAS LEFT WASHINGTON

00:00:05.849 --> 00:00:08.818
FOR THE WEEKEND, SEEMINGLY NO

00:00:08.819 --> 00:00:11.754
CLOSER TO A RESOLUTION OF THE

00:00:11.755 --> 00:00:12.889
SHUTDOWN THAN WHEN IT BEGAN

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:13.990
THREE FULL WEEKS AGO.

00:00:13.991 --> 00:00:16.592
MIKE EMANUEL IS ON A VERY QUIET

00:00:16.593 --> 00:00:17.860
CAPITOL HILL TONIGHT.

00:00:17.861 --> 00:00:18.995
GOOD EVENING.

00:00:18.996 --> 00:00:20.863
&gt;&gt; Reporter: GOOD EVENING, BRET.

00:00:20.864 --> 00:00:22.799
THERE ARE NO NEGOTIATIONS TAKING

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.199
PLACE.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.467
CONGRESS IS GONE FOR THE

00:00:24.468 --> 00:00:24.801
WEEKEND.

00:00:24.802 --> 00:00:26.702
OTHERS ARE LEFT WITH ANXIETY AND

00:00:26.703 --> 00:00:27.103
UNCERTAINTY.

00:00:27.104 --> 00:00:32.809
&gt;&gt; TODAY, 800,000 FEDERAL

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:35.311
EMPLOYEES WILL NOT RECEIVE THEIR

00:00:35.312 --> 00:00:38.881
FIRST PAYCHECK OF THIS NEW YEAR.

00:00:38.882 --> 00:00:40.249
&gt;&gt; Reporter: 21 DAYS INTO A

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.251
PARTIAL SHUTDOWN AND REALITY IS

00:00:42.252 --> 00:00:44.787
HITTING HOME FOR THOUSANDS OF

00:00:44.788 --> 00:00:45.455
FEDERAL WORKERS.

00:00:45.456 --> 00:00:47.824
TODAY, THE HOUSE APPROVED A

00:00:47.825 --> 00:00:49.792
SENATE PLAN TO PROVIDE THEM WITH

00:00:49.793 --> 00:00:51.093
THEIR MISSED PAY.

00:00:51.094 --> 00:00:53.362
NOT UNTIL THE PARTIAL SHUTDOWN

00:00:53.363 --> 00:00:53.763
ENDS.

00:00:53.764 --> 00:00:55.198
BACK PAY WHEN THE GOVERNMENT

00:00:55.199 --> 00:00:55.665
OPENS.

00:00:55.666 --> 00:00:57.467
IT DOESN'T DO YOU MUCH GOOD IF

00:00:57.468 --> 00:00:58.801
YOU HAVE BILLS THAT COME NEXT

00:00:58.802 --> 00:00:59.101
WEEK.

00:00:59.102 --> 00:01:00.369
&gt;&gt; AMONG THOSE THAT ARE NOT

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:01.604
GETTING PAID, THE PEOPLE ON THE

00:01:01.605 --> 00:01:03.172
FRONT LINE OF THE ILLEGAL

00:01:03.173 --> 00:01:03.940
IMMIGRATION FIGHT.

00:01:03.941 --> 00:01:05.374
&gt;&gt; THE BRAVE MEN AND WOMEN THAT

00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:07.410
ARE ON THE GROUND EVERY DAY

00:01:07.411 --> 00:01:09.412
SECURING OUR BORDER SHOULD GET

00:01:09.413 --> 00:01:09.712
PAID.

00:01:09.713 --> 00:01:10.913
&gt;&gt; WITH PRESIDENT TRUMP STANDING

00:01:10.914 --> 00:01:13.549
FIRM ON FUNDING TO BUILD A

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:15.284
BORDER WALL, FRUSTRATION IS

00:01:15.285 --> 00:01:16.419
SPILLING OVER ON BOTH SIDES OF

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:17.286
THE WALL.

00:01:17.287 --> 00:01:19.121
&gt;&gt; WE MAY SOON HAVE ENOUGH TRASH

00:01:19.122 --> 00:01:20.456
BUILDING UP TO BUILD A WALL.

00:01:20.457 --> 00:01:23.125
IS THAT THE IDEA, MR. TRUMP?

00:01:23.126 --> 00:01:24.794
WE COULD END THIS CRISIS TODAY.

00:01:24.795 --> 00:01:26.929
21 DAYS IN IS TOO LONG.

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:28.130
THERE IS A SOLUTION.

00:01:28.131 --> 00:01:29.432
THE SOLUTION INCLUDES, IT IS NOT

00:01:29.433 --> 00:01:31.033
GOING TO BE YOUR WAY OR THE

00:01:31.034 --> 00:01:31.367
HIGHWAY.

00:01:31.368 --> 00:01:32.668
&gt;&gt; MIAMI INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT

00:01:32.669 --> 00:01:35.671
IS CLOSING THE TERMINAL THIS

00:01:35.672 --> 00:01:37.440
WEEKEND BECAUSE TSA SCREENERS

00:01:37.441 --> 00:01:39.408
HAVE BEEN CALLING IN SICK AT A

00:01:39.409 --> 00:01:40.276
HIGHER RATE.

00:01:40.277 --> 00:01:42.378
THERE WON'T BE ENOUGH STAFFING

00:01:42.379 --> 00:01:45.648
TO HANDLE ALL 11 CHECKPOINTS.

00:01:45.649 --> 00:01:47.850
CHRIS VAN HOLLAND NOTED THAT THE

00:01:47.851 --> 00:01:49.852
COAST GUARD TOLD EMPLOYEES A

00:01:49.853 --> 00:01:51.354
GARAGE SALE COULD HELP COPE WITH

00:01:51.355 --> 00:01:52.154
A SHUTDOWN.

00:01:52.155 --> 00:01:53.789
&gt;&gt; WHEN THE PRESIDENT OF THE

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:54.790
UNITED STATES SAYS HE CAN

00:01:54.791 --> 00:01:56.325
RELATE, I WANT TO SEE HIM HOLD A

00:01:56.326 --> 00:01:57.260
GARAGE SALE.

00:01:57.261 --> 00:01:58.661
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THERE ARE SOME

00:01:58.662 --> 00:02:00.329
SIDES THAT BREAK FROM THE RANKS

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:03.165
WITH LISA MURKOWSKI WARNING IF

00:02:03.166 --> 00:02:03.966
PRESIDENT TRUMP DECLARES A

00:02:03.967 --> 00:02:05.167
NATIONAL EMERGENCY, IT COULD

00:02:05.168 --> 00:02:06.369
LEAD TO FUTURE PROBLEMS.

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:08.271
&gt;&gt; WE DON'T KNOW WHO OUR NEXT

00:02:08.272 --> 00:02:09.105
PRESIDENT MAY BE.

00:02:09.106 --> 00:02:14.544
IT MAY BE A PRESIDENT WHOSE

00:02:14.545 --> 00:02:16.712
NUMBER ONE PRIORITY IS DEALING

00:02:16.713 --> 00:02:17.280
WITH CLIMATE CHANGE.

00:02:17.281 --> 00:02:18.814
HE MAY SAY, I DON'T CARE WHETHER

00:02:18.815 --> 00:02:20.583
I HAVE THE SUPPORT OF THE

00:02:20.584 --> 00:02:20.983
CONGRESS.

00:02:20.984 --> 00:02:22.785
ONE FRESHMAN DEMOCRAT SAID SHE

00:02:22.786 --> 00:02:24.253
COULD VOTE IN SUPPORT OF A

00:02:24.254 --> 00:02:24.587
BARRIER.

00:02:24.588 --> 00:02:26.389
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW IF IT IS STEEL.

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:31.762
I WILL VOTE FOR SOME MONEY FOR

